#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:4
msgid "Zero-downtime upgrades (Experimental)"
msgstr "不停機升級（Experimental）"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:8
msgid ""
"Upgrade one component at a time while inference continues. Choose the "
"component whose code or environment needs changing; replacing a control "
"process keeps existing model processes and their loaded weights running."
msgstr "在推論持續執行的同時，每次升級一個元件。依照需要修改的程式碼或環境選擇元件；替換控制程序時，既有模型程序及其已載入的權重會繼續執行。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:11
msgid "Prepare an upgrade"
msgstr "升級準備"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:13
msgid ""
"The running deployment must already support the relevant replacement "
"protocol and service host. API, Supervisor and Worker replacement support "
"distributed deployments on Linux and macOS, not local mode or Windows. "
"Model-engine replacement has the Linux GPU requirements described below."
msgstr ""
"目前執行中的部署必須已支援相應的替換協定和服務宿主程序。API、Supervisor 和 Worker 替換支援 Linux 和 macOS "
"上的分散式部署，不支援本機模式或 Windows。模型引擎替換還需符合下文的 Linux GPU 要求。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:15
msgid ""
"Install a compatible Xinference version and its dependencies in a separate "
"environment first. ``python_executable`` is an absolute Python path on the "
"Supervisor machine for API/Supervisor upgrades, or on the Worker machine for"
" Worker/model upgrades. Packages are not installed by these operations. Omit"
" the path to reuse the current environment. Use an administrator session "
"when authentication is enabled."
msgstr ""
"先在獨立環境中安裝相容的 Xinference 版本及其相依套件。 ``python_executable`` 是 Python "
"的絕對路徑：API/Supervisor 升級使用 Supervisor 所在機器上的路徑，Worker/模型升級使用 Worker "
"所在機器上的路徑。這些操作不會安裝套件。省略路徑會重用目前環境。啟用身分驗證時，請使用管理員工作階段。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:18
msgid "API and Web UI"
msgstr "API 和 Web UI"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:20
msgid "In **Cluster Information**, choose **Restart / upgrade API**, or run:"
msgstr "在 **叢集資訊** 中選擇 **重新啟動 / 升級 API** ，或執行："

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:27
msgid ""
"The public HTTP address stays the same. New connections use the replacement "
"API; existing requests and streams finish on the previous API. The "
"Supervisor, Workers and models keep running. Refresh the browser to load the"
" upgraded Web UI. See :doc:`api_relaunch`."
msgstr ""
"對外 HTTP 位址保持不變。新連線使用替換後的 API，既有請求和串流由原 API 執行完成。Supervisor、Worker "
"和模型繼續執行。重新整理瀏覽器以載入升級後的 Web UI。請參閱 :doc:`api_relaunch` 。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:30
msgid "Supervisor"
msgstr "Supervisor"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:32
msgid ""
"In **Cluster Information**, choose **Restart / upgrade Supervisor**, or run:"
msgstr "在 **叢集資訊** 中選擇 **重新啟動 / 升級 Supervisor** ，或執行："

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:39
msgid ""
"The API, Workers and models keep running, and public addresses stay the "
"same. Inference routes remain available while management operations briefly "
"wait during state transfer. Finish active model launches, downloads, reloads"
" and Worker handoffs before upgrading. See :doc:`supervisor_relaunch`."
msgstr ""
"API、Worker "
"和模型繼續執行，對外位址保持不變。狀態移轉期間，推論路由仍然可用，管理操作會短暫等待。升級前，請先完成進行中的模型啟動、下載、重新載入和 Worker "
"交接。請參閱 :doc:`supervisor_relaunch` 。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:42
msgid "Worker"
msgstr "Worker"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:44
msgid ""
"In **Cluster Information**, choose **Restart / upgrade Worker** on the "
"Worker to upgrade, or use its current actor address:"
msgstr "在 **叢集資訊** 中，對需要升級的 Worker 選擇 **重新啟動 / 升級 Worker** ，或使用其目前的 Actor 位址："

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:58
msgid ""
"The Worker starts its replacement and transfers model ownership "
"automatically. Model processes, their code and GPU weights stay in place; "
"this does not upgrade the model engine. Both environments need Xoscar 0.12.1"
" or later and compatible handoff support. Multi-Worker models and Xavier/P/D"
" deployments are unsupported. See :doc:`worker_handoff`."
msgstr ""
"Worker 會自動啟動替換程序並移交模型管理權。模型程序、其程式碼和 GPU 權重保持原樣，因此該操作不會升級模型引擎。兩個環境都需要 Xoscar "
"0.12.1 或更新版本及相容的交接支援。不支援跨 Worker 的模型以及 Xavier/P/D 部署。請參閱 "
":doc:`worker_handoff` 。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:61
msgid "Model and engine"
msgstr "模型和引擎"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:63
msgid ""
"Open a running model's detail view and choose **Reconfigure / upgrade "
"model**. Engine replacement requires **Keep GPU weights for reload** "
"(``enable_weight_cache=true``) at launch, vLLM 0.31.0+ or SGLang 0.5.21+, "
"Linux with CUDA or ROCm, one Worker, one replica and fixed tensor "
"parallelism. To select a prepared model environment:"
msgstr ""
"開啟執行中模型的詳細資料，選擇 **重新設定 / 升級模型** 。替換引擎需要在啟動時開啟 **保留 GPU 權重以支援重載** （ "
"``enable_weight_cache=true`` ），使用 vLLM 0.31.0+ 或 SGLang 0.5.21+、配備 CUDA 或 "
"ROCm 的 Linux、單一 Worker、單一副本和固定的張量平行度。若要選擇已準備好的模型環境："

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:75
msgid ""
"The current engine serves until its replacement is healthy, then existing "
"requests finish on the old engine. Compatible engine and PyTorch versions "
"can share retained weights, but each engine needs its own KV cache and CUDA "
"graphs. Reserve extra GPU memory; incompatible versions also need a separate"
" weight cache. Insufficient memory rejects the upgrade while the current "
"engine keeps serving. See :ref:`launch_weight_cache_reload` for supported "
"changes and limitations."
msgstr ""
"新引擎通過健康檢查前，目前引擎繼續服務；切換後，既有請求由舊引擎執行完成。相容的引擎和 PyTorch 版本可以共用保留的權重，但每個引擎仍需獨立的 "
"KV cache 和 CUDA "
"graphs。請預留額外顯示記憶體；不相容的版本還需要獨立的權重快取。記憶體不足時會拒絕升級，目前引擎繼續服務。支援的修改和限制請參閱 "
":ref:`launch_weight_cache_reload` 。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:78
msgid "Progress and recovery"
msgstr "進度與復原"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:80
msgid ""
"Submission returns HTTP 202 and an ``operation_id``; acceptance does not "
"mean completion. Follow progress in the Web UI or the component's status "
"API. API, Supervisor and Worker operations finish with ``succeeded`` or "
"``failed``; model reload finishes with ``ready`` or ``error``. API "
"``draining`` means the replacement is serving while previous requests "
"finish."
msgstr ""
"提交後會傳回 HTTP 202 和 ``operation_id`` ；請求被接受不代表升級完成。可在 Web UI 或對應元件的狀態 API "
"中查看進度。API、Supervisor 和 Worker 操作以 ``succeeded`` 或 ``failed`` 結束；模型重新載入以 "
"``ready`` 或 ``error`` 結束。API 的 ``draining`` 表示新 API 已開始服務，舊 API 正在完成既有請求。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:82
msgid ""
"Reuse the same ``request_id`` when retrying an API, Supervisor or Worker "
"submission. If a Worker operation is ``pending``, keep both processes alive "
"and continue polling: ownership transfer is uncertain. Failed preparation "
"keeps the previous component serving; for model errors, ``restored=true`` "
"confirms the previous engine is serving."
msgstr ""
"重試 API、Supervisor 或 Worker 提交請求時，重用同一個 ``request_id`` 。若 Worker 操作處於 "
"``pending`` ，請保持兩個程序執行並繼續輪詢，此時模型管理權是否已移交尚不確定。準備失敗時，原元件繼續服務；模型出錯時， "
"``restored=true`` 表示原引擎正在服務。"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:85
msgid "Upgrade boundaries"
msgstr "升級範圍"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:87
msgid ""
"Keep service hosts and containers running throughout an upgrade. Stopping "
"them also stops retained processes and releases GPU allocations. Supervisor "
"support actors retain their original environments. Updating these hosts, "
"retained support actors or database schemas requires a planned restart; "
"these operations do not upgrade an entire installation at once."
msgstr ""
"升級期間必須保持服務宿主程序和容器執行。停止它們也會終止保留的程序並釋放 GPU 資源。Supervisor 的輔助 Actor "
"保留原來的環境。更新這些宿主程序、保留的輔助 Actor 或資料庫結構需要安排停機重新啟動；這些操作不會一次升級整個安裝。"

